    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "Five times a number minus two times the number is equal to six times the same number minus 12. What is the number?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$4$.\n\nCollect like terms, then solve the resulting equation.",
      "worked": "Let $x$ be the number.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}5x-2x&=6x-12\\\\3x&=6x-12\\\\12&=3x\\\\x&=4\\end{align*}$$\n\nCheck: $5\\times4-2\\times4=12$ and $6\\times4-12=12$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
